OL,3,GNEWSAEarly release: What's happening
OL,4,Awith prisoners in Scotland?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe fury over the potential early
OL,7,Frelease in England of the two teenagers
OL,8,Fwho killed PC Andrew Harper has focused
OL,9,Fpublic attention on prison overcrowding
OL,10,Fin a way that hasn't happened in
OL,11,FScotland.
OL,13,FThe Scottish government has ventured
OL,14,Finto similarly contentious territory as
OL,15,Fit tries to find a long-term solution
OL,16,Fto Scotland's record-breaking prison
OL,17,Fpopulation.
OL,19,FBut the absence of such a controversial
OL,20,Fcase has largely kept the story out of
OL,21,Fthe headlines.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
