OL,3,GNEWSAEarly release: What's happening
OL,4,Awith prisoners in Scotland?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe key proposal from the SNP
OL,7,Fadministration is to bring forward the
OL,8,Fautomatic release point for hundreds of
OL,9,Fpeople convicted of offences including
OL,10,Frape and culpable homicide - Scotland's
OL,11,Fversion of manslaughter.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
